OL,3,GNEWSAFaith in mental health crisis
OL,4,Ateams 'lost'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMental health campaigners on the Isle
OL,7,Fof Man have claimed people are being
OL,8,Fturned away from services whose help
OL,9,Fthey need.
OL,11,FJuan Moore, who set up support group
OL,12,FManx Pact, said people had "lost faith
OL,13,Fin the crisis team" provided by Manx
OL,14,FCare, arguing there needed to be more
OL,15,Fstaff and more funding.
OL,17,FAn MKH also said that teams dedicated
OL,18,Fto preventing suicide were "not fully
OL,19,Fresourced and connected".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
